    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I reproduced this on latest version of the `main` branch\n\n### Neovim version\n\n0.13 (!at least latest Nightly build!)\n\n### Description\n\n```\n 09:57:40 │ (mini.misc) Error during safe execution: /Users/justin/.config/nvim-minimax/plugin/30_mini.lua:538: module 'mini.input' not found:\n\n    no field package.preload['mini.input']\n\n    no file './mini/input.lua'\n\n    no file '/Users/runner/work/neovim/neovim/.deps/usr/share/luajit-2.1/mini/input.lua'\n\n    no file '/usr/local/share/lua/5.1/mini/input.lua'\n\n    no file '/usr/local/share/lua/5.1/mini/input/init.lua'\n\n    no file '/Users/runner/work/neovim/neovim/.deps/usr/share/lua/5.1/mini/input.lua'\n\n    no file '/Users/runner/work/neovim/neovim/.deps/usr/share/lua/5.1/mini/input/init.lua'\n\n    no file './mini/input.so'\n\n    no file '/usr/local/lib/lua/5.1/mini/input.so'\n\n    no file '/Users/runner/work/neovim/neovim/.deps/usr/lib/lua/5.1/mini/input.so'\n\n    no file '/usr/local/lib/lua/5.1/loadall.so'\n\n    no file './mini.so'\n\n    no file '/usr/local/lib/lua/5.1/mini.so'\n\n    no file '/Users/runner/work/neovim/neovim/.deps/usr/lib/lua/5.1/mini.so'\n\n    no file '/usr/local/lib/lua/5.1/loadall.so'\n\n\nstack traceback:\n\n    /Users/justin/.config/nvim-minimax/plugin/30_mini.lua:538: in function </Users/justin/.config/nvim-minimax/plugin/30_mini.lua:538>\n\n    [C]: in function 'xpcall'\n\n    ...m-minimax/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/misc.lua:360: in function 'execute_now'\n\n    ...m-minimax/site/pack/core/opt/mini.nvim/lua/mini/misc.lua:380: in function 'fn'\n\n    [string \"vim/_core/editor\"]:408: in function <[string \"vim/_core/editor\"]:407>\n\n\nTraceback of `MiniMisc.safely()` call:\n\n\nstack traceback:\n\n    /Users/justin/.config/nvim-minimax/init.lua:125: in function 'later'\n\n    /Users/justin/.config/nvim-minimax/plugin/30_mini.lua:538: in main chunk \n```\n\n### Reproduction\n\nFresh install on a mac.\nneovim in